abstract: >-
  Research code, result tables, figures, and draft papers for experiments on
  linguistic transformation geometry in transformer embedding spaces, including
  endpoint controls, hard-holdout boundary analyses, signed permutation
  diagnostics, and cross-model transformation-transfer roadmaps.
